    "summary": "CoreWeave's refinancing struggles could lead to bankruptcy, impacting investor confidence and the broader AI-cloud infrastructure market.\nThe post CoreWeave faces refinancing risks amid $35B debt challenge appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
